{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9da8ebb91c9462af0772bb9a8c189e13c1fb0887414731c8885383d6ccd206b1","ja":"がんばったリーダーに","zh":"致努力过的队长","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c0292cd146a4504e07d45311d1255e6a5700b93cfa5a5bd779625568b953fddb","ja":"あっ、この写真、\n公演の後に撮ったやつじゃん～。","zh":"啊，这张照片，\n不是演出结束后拍的吗～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9cf9abb22a56ffa89c6b1de2f42650d5eb6127051096345faa1516f236913862","ja":"ほ？　恵美ちゃん、なにを見てるのです……？\nなるほど、この前のユニット公演の写真なのですね！","zh":"咦？惠美，你在看什么……？\n原来是前些日子那场组合公演的照片啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4707e2ac4ca20629c6fbe80cb2f90c54bedcf520fb863f92091b0c0184a9d80d","ja":"そうそう！　さっき●●●●プロデューサーから\nもらったんだ♪　公演の後に4人で撮った集合写真！","zh":"对了对了！这是刚才从●●●●制作人那里拿到的♪  \n公演结束后和4人一起拍的合照！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cdcb6a5943218b06ff690642da973e6c1f6bfa97f5bee5a221e726d5a12df1af","ja":"真、先日の全国ツアーは、良き経験でしたね。\nレッスンも本番も、忘れられない思い出です。","zh":"真，前几天的全国巡演是一次很宝贵的经历呢。\n无论是训练还是正式演出，都是令人难忘的回忆。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"71d9fa5f320d80505b494ba625b1185fef411819dd1e151e805f71ee389b7721","ja":"ま、一番がんばってくれたメンバーは、\n今ここにいないんだけどね～。","zh":"不过，最努力的那位成员现在不在这里就是了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3c8be461cc32900ada5c4b8ea7473fe8bd61d2bbfc5fdd5f4f9bfa110c47678a","ja":"そうですね。リーダーとしてユニットを引っ張って\nくれた翼ちゃんの頑張りは大きかったのです！","zh":"是啊。作为队长带领组合一路前进，翼付出的努力功不可没！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"03280c236f53d879e83aa46519de6fcc4f14bd1e949477d27607cdafc272de62","ja":"うん！　それでアタシ、思ったんだけど……\n翼になにか、お返ししてあげない？","zh":"嗯！然后我就在想……要不要回送翼点什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8c6d7baeb9d237fb55241f8049b59067a1db8a1a83d4c16e6d1a655688406db6","ja":"お返し、ですか。なるほど、良い提案ですね。\nですが、どうすれば喜んでもらえるでしょうか？","zh":"回礼吗？原来如此，真是个不错的提议。\n不过，要怎么做才能让对方开心呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b9b8cab5699f8adf0154db37abc636cdc14e029e22e6f9e0dc14194cf37b4953","ja":"それなら、姫にとっておきのアイデアがあるのです！\nまず、お仕事から帰ってきた翼ちゃんに……。","zh":"既然这样，姬有个绝妙的主意哦！  \n首先，等翼工作回来之后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"512c978555ff17f685a25f06278b31bc66a4b53a59be09d2665194700e55b2a5","ja":"こしょこしょこしょ……。","zh":"窃窃私语……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a0920a85bfdca4cff52f8f7ac9309eec5d51047ed2eeb21261a76103b4844722","ja":"ふむふむ……。うん、いいアイデアじゃん！\nその作戦で行こうよ！","zh":"嗯嗯……好，这主意不错！\n就按这个计划来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_912.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"656b3e33d68133f364be84d89ae475efa8eaa26d13c89026e889e00e52ba80c0","ja":"それでは、さっそく準備と参りましょう。\nふふ、きっと翼も喜んでくれるかと。","zh":"那么，我们马上开始准备吧。\n呵呵，翼一定也会很开心的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
